      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Close instance suppose to be instance killing function, it to prevent instances being alive forever and show up pernamently in group lists and other menues, just because some one fell asleep there, or in case group publics people pernamently joining there. So i think you probably suggesting some other instince state allowing to templetly lock the instance and allow only specific. This can be done too if they implement instance updating  this way you can apply role restrictions",
