  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-11T18:20:15.928Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be extremely helpful to give group staff roles a permission that allows them to join closed instances. This would be great for if an instance is still full when closed, so you can keep moderation. \n\nAnother use case would be closing the instance when something like a crasher occurs, and then rejoining to figure out who it is and ban them",
